Daily AI Workflow

Whenever you study, use prompts like:

Teacher Mode

Teach me Python step by step. Don't skip prerequisites.

Practice Mode

Give me 10 problems on dictionaries from easy to hard.

Debug Mode

Explain why this code fails and guide me to fix it.

Interview Mode

Conduct a Python interview and ask one question at a time.

Project Mode

Help me build this project, but don't write the full solution